    "text": "1 booked on public order charge in Colleton County on July 26\nBy\nR. O. TorresOn July 26, 2026, one person was booked on a public order charge in Colleton County, SC.\nPeople booked on charges in the Public Order category at facilities in Colleton County, SC on July 26\nTimothy Martise Terrill Siplin\nColleton County Sheriff's Office\nListed charges: Charge: 16-17-725(B) - GIVING FALSE INFORMATION TO POLICE (MISREPRESENTING IDENTITY)",
